      <p class="cm-section-summary">AI grounded search reads embedded JSON-LD in HTML. Developers query REST. Agentic AI clients (Claude Desktop, Cursor) call MCP tools. AI crawlers index via <code class="cm-inline-code">/llms.txt</code>. Same canonical record at every surface.</p>
